# Unity Log Reader Integration

This folder contains a Unity console log reader tool that allows Claude Code to check Unity console errors and warnings.

## What's Included
- `UnityConsoleReader.exe` - Main executable
- `UnityConsoleReader.dll` - Required library
- `UnityConsoleReader.runtimeconfig.json` - Runtime configuration

## Usage
The tool can be run with: `./Assets/ClaudeCodeIntegration/LogReader/UnityConsoleReader.exe`

It will:
1. Force Unity recompilation to catch any new errors
2. Read the Unity Editor.log file
3. Display recent errors and warnings from the console

## Claude Code Integration Instructions

This is a .MDI (Markdown Instruction) file. Add the content below to your project's CLAUDE.md file so Claude Code knows it can check Unity logs:

```
## Unity Log Reader

This project includes a Unity log reader tool at `Assets/ClaudeCodeIntegration/LogReader/UnityConsoleReader.exe`.

You can check Unity console errors and warnings by running:
`./Assets/ClaudeCodeIntegration/LogReader/UnityConsoleReader.exe`

This tool will force recompilation and show recent Unity console errors/warnings.
```